# Entire Android/Gradle project is generated by `bubblewrap update` from
# twa-manifest.json (see README.md) — CI regenerates it fresh on every release,
# so it isn't committed. Run `npx @bubblewrap/cli update --skipVersionUpgrade`
# locally to materialize it before building/opening in Android Studio.
